    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mi>o</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn